    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31051" root="عوق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُوَاقٌ</span></b>  <i>A sound that issues from the belly of a
beast,</i> or <i>horse</i> or <i>the like, when he is going along;</i>
(O, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُعَاقٌ</span>: (O:) and some say, <i>a
sound</i> of anything. (TA.)

